{"v":4,"catch":"在這個非常令人滿意的謎題中，\n將網格劃分為長方形。","desc":"\"Shikaku \"是Nikoli自己的一個原創casse-tête，規則簡單，解題的感覺很獨特。在你習慣之前，你會傾向於用猜測的方式來解決卡塞特，但真正的魅力在於用邏輯來解決它們。一旦你掌握了通過從數字中逐漸拉長方格來解決卡塞特的方法，你就能在更深的層次上享受 \"Shikaku\"。\n\n選項菜單、手冊和其他文字都有日語、英語、法語、德語、意大利語和西班牙語版本。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-04-13","genres":["益智","桌上遊戲","訓練","學習"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2d535823c1696710be574c252662eb2bda4f6356fb0dd808f159ae9dcc2652e5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/34771215533bfaf15b87f5f55cd66471c379108799131b04664e040ba1e9a449.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4cae87134d7b2f499f8885316b28abdde484f43f7865e7217bb78f130156b4e9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/468bdb418df0377716abc32977e4393c9b8e94dc84324e116d0dc7929204aeb9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/905939daa2d38ce2346366fb675b01a844ce46f73bc60e1c36eb2a687014db62.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a64bc8a402d56818ec64a20d88345c8956e85477a2134f7658ef1f3ebc628a89.jpg"],"titleId":"010087500e984000","dlc":[]}